dentification of differentially expressed and MAR-binding proteins</article-title><source>Exp Cell Res</source><year>2009</year><volume>315</volume><fpage>226</fpage><lpage>239</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Exp Cell Res||315|226||bib5|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19000672</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Barboro</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Rubagotti</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Boccardo</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Carnemolla</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>D'Arrigo</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Patrone</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Balbi</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Nuclear matrix protein expression in prostate cancer: possible prognostic and diagnostic applications</article-title><source>Anticancer Res</source><year>2005</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>3999</fpage><lpage>4004</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Anticancer Res||25|3999||bib6|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16309191</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Barboro</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Rubagotti</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Orecchia</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Spina</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Truini</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Repaci</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Carmignani</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Romagnoli</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Introini</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Boccardo</surname><given-names>F</given-nam