pan="5" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Within the NM and the whole cell</italic><sup>b</sup></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02a7d;0.60 and &#x0003c;10</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">16</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.0</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02a7d;0.60 and &#x02a7e;10</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">14</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">6</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3.96 (0.79&#x02013;19.86)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x0003e;0.60 and &#x0003c;10</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">7</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5.03 (0.83&#x02013;30.51)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.08</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x0003e;0.60 and &#x02a7e;10</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">9</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">9.49 (1.61&#x02013;55.82)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.013</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="5" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Within the NM and the cytoplasm</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02a7d;0.60 and &#x0003c;4</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">12</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.0</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02a7d;0.60 and &#x02a7e;4</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">18</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">6</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.41 (0.48&#x02013;12.03)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.3</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x0003e;0.60 and &#x0003c;4</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">7</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3.89 (0.64&#x02013;23.67)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x0003e;0.60 and &#x02a7e;4</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">9</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">7.34 (1.25&#x02013;43.13)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.025</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t3-fn1"><label>a</label><p>obs (observed)=number of patients with a biochemical progression.</p></fn><fn id="t3-fn2"><label>b</label><p>hnRNP K expression level was determined within the NM by WB and in whole cell or in cytoplasm by IHC.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>